	width=&#34;1658&#34;
	height=&#34;1221&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.2_hu_e2d20e678e1d1fa0.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.2_hu_dc0c41e2b8764b09.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;135&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;325px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;2使用-1&#34;&gt;2.使用
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;直接将解密文件拖入Audacity&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.3.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1527&#34;
	height=&#34;998&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.3_hu_a3f971d47f4bba01.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.3_hu_6712470547a32e15.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;153&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;367px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
下面介绍最常用的功能&lt;br&gt;
查看波形图&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.4.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1527&#34;
	height=&#34;998&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.4_hu_c822b956c7a3583e.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.4_hu_efe585364510643.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;153&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;367px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
若解题思路正确的话，一般会直接出现flag,或者出现明显的摩斯密码图（音频有长有短）&lt;br&gt;
若查看频谱图看不出明显题解&lt;br&gt;
可以尝试改变频谱图最高频率&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.5.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1539&#34;
	height=&#34;1108&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.5_hu_749717310703ff74.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/2.5_hu_6334470ef20f576a.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;138&#34;
