&lt;h2 id=&#34;三-工具-deepsound-附带deepsound2john爆破&#34;&gt;三. 工具 Deepsound (附带deepsound2john爆破)
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;1下载-2&#34;&gt;1.下载
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;下载地址： &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://gitcode.com/open-source-toolkit/e746d/?utm_source=tools_gitcode&amp;amp;index=top&amp;amp;type=card&amp;amp;&amp;amp;uuid_tt_dd=10_37229547440-1757036127093-231989&amp;amp;isLogin=1&amp;amp;from_id=141944208&amp;amp;from_link&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
