&lt;h3 id=&#34;2配置与使用&#34;&gt;2.配置与使用
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;打开软件后，点击Setup，选择Sound Control and Devices。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.9.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1473&#34;
	height=&#34;1015&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.9_hu_b431557574e2ac9e.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.9_hu_5a04ecb9fa24cc98.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;145&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;348px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
在播放选项下，将Line1设置为默认值。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.10.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;723&#34;
	height=&#34;812&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.10_hu_272f89bbbfb22916.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.10_hu_b4f545db4bacdc70.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;89&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;213px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
录制选项下也一样。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.11.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;723&#34;
	height=&#34;812&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.11_hu_c046e371bd071adf.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.11_hu_30fa4680d12a858e.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;89&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;213px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
配置完后，修改下一些设置。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.12.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1046&#34;
	height=&#34;414&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.12_hu_a012b870031a96f5.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.12_hu_c30105862160b59c.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;252&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;606px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
按我下面的设置即可。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.13.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1107&#34;
	height=&#34;803&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.13_hu_d6d9a79785e750e6.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.13_hu_b35ae729a76eafdb.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;137&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;330px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
这些设置完后，即可打开音频进行监听了。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.14.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1473&#34;
	height=&#34;1015&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.14_hu_5d37785b9319200a.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.14_hu_871e5eeb95f29ab3.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;145&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;348px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;3例题-3&#34;&gt;3.例题
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;音频扫描工具，可以使用 RX-SSTV 或者 QSSTV，我这里使用的是 RX-SSTV&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.15.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1420&#34;
	height=&#34;997&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.15_hu_713406dc8f1fe984.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.15_hu_b92ab33ac7168b34.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;142&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;341px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
打开使用时，需要将接受音频的麦克风改为 Virtual Audio Streaming (或VSC)接收，这里也需要到网上下载。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.16.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1496&#34;
	height=&#34;959&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.16_hu_98b3d71e1521471c.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.16_hu_cf00944950bc78a2.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;155&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;374px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
用这个打开题目的音频文件，同时使用 RX-SSTV 进行监听。监听时需要用到 ML280（不过点击点击监听时软件应该会自动跳转，可以不用刻意去调），下面为监听结果输出图。&lt;br&gt;
&lt;img src=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.17.jpg&#34;
	width=&#34;1739&#34;
	height=&#34;442&#34;
	srcset=&#34;https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.17_hu_96df68eeff2087ec.jpg 480w, https://dongyuzzz5.github.io/p/misc1/5.17_hu_a7aa614db5062a52.jpg 1024w&#34;
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;393&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;944px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;br&gt;
结果为 flag{6bdfeac1e2baa12d6ac5384cdfd166b0}&lt;/p&gt;
